+#: ⚠️ Renamed 2026-10-19: relevance is a **two-dimensional composite**, so the two dimensions must be
+#: filled in separately; otherwise "judge relevance" would remain ambiguous between the composite score
+#: and the technical-problem score.
+#:
+#:   relevance_problem  — technical problem relevance 1–5
+#:   relevance_means    — technical means relevance 1–5
+#:   composite          — relevance = min(relevance_problem, relevance_means) (see relevance_dimensions in the glossary)
+#:
+#: `role` returns to its **original meaning**: near_prior_art / pool / excluded / family;
