-"""Full consistency validation. Any error -> exit 1.
-
-Rule table
-----------
-V001 error  JSON parse failure / does not match candidates_schema.json
-V002 error  candidate id duplicated, or does not match ^[PL]-\\d{3,}$
-V003 error  file pointed to by source_log does not exist
-V004 error  bibtex_key not found in 06_citation_management/*.bib (placeholder keys of template files do not count)
-V005 warn   .bib entry has no matching candidate (reverse orphan) - template files exempt
-V006 error  log file name does not match <DB>_<YYYY-MM-DD>_<queryID>_<hits>.log.json
-V007 error  log query.id disagrees with the queryID segment of the file name
-V008 error  log result.hit_count disagrees with the hits segment of the file name
-V009 error  capture_mode=live but raw_export missing / file does not exist / is empty
-V010 warn   log db field disagrees with the DB segment of the file name (after normalization)
-V011 error  tags contain an axis ID that is not registered in the glossary
-V012 error  runs reference an unknown candidate ID
-V013 error  evidence_level=verified but evidence_ref missing / file does not exist
-V014 error  normalized publication numbers are identical - genuine duplicate entry
-V028 info   title + first applicant + year all identical - possibly a family member or double publication in the same year
-V015 error  logged_at is not an ISO8601 timestamp with timezone
-V016 warn   time_window endpoint is later than today
-V017 error  novelty_check=blocking, but the run containing this document says novelty_pass (conflicting statements)
-V018 warn   role=near_prior_art, but its document number never appears in any run
-V019 warn   pending migration: candidate lacks evidence_level or role (tool infers conservative values)
-V020 warn   pending migration: log lacks capture_mode (tool treats it as retrospective)
-V021 error  evidence_level=attested but evidence_ref or evidence_sha256 is missing
-V022 warn   a JSON file under 02_search_logs is not named *.log.json (it is never loaded - effectively silently lost)
-V023 warn   pending migration: tag is a v1 bare axis name (`N1`); qualify it to `N1@TGT-xxxx`
-V024 warn   pending migration: missing target field (filter key of the v2 multi-target gates); error if the value is not registered
-V025 error  qualified target of a tag disagrees with the candidate target field
-V026 warn   raw artifact record count < declared hit count (the export may contain only some pages)
-V027 error  draft registry structure is invalid
